# Credentials. Nothing here may ever be committed: the Dart define file holds
# the Supabase publishable key and the public Google client IDs, and the other
# entries are outright secrets (Google OAuth client secret, service-role keys,
# release signing material).
dart_defines.json
dart_defines.*.json
!dart_defines.example.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
android/app/google-services.json
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
*.pem

